We're having such a good time talking about season three.
我们聊第三季聊得太开心了。

00:37:20.619 --> 00:37:24.619
This is just such a delight to go through the show again with all of you.
能和大家再次重温这部剧，真是一件令人愉快的事。

00:37:24.619 --> 00:37:35.760
If you'd like to let us know how I met your mother or how we made your mother has landed on you, how it's affected your life, what you're getting from the rewatch.
如果你想让我们知道《老爸老妈浪漫史》或《我们是如何创造老爸老妈的》给你带来了怎样的感受，它如何影响了你的生活，你在重温中收获了什么。

00:37:35.760 --> 00:37:37.480
How it's changed over time.
它随时间发生了怎样的变化。

